                                        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded bg-tactical-cyan/10 text-tactical-cyan border border-tactical-cyan/30">STEALTH HOST</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <p class="text-xs text-tactical-muted mt-1 leading-relaxed">
